<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Happy Birthday ❤️</title>

<style>

body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffdde1,#ee9ca7);
overflow-x:hidden;
color:white;
text-align:center;
}

section{
min-height:100vh;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
padding:30px;
}

h1{
font-size:3em;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

h2{
font-size:2em;
}

p{
max-width:700px;
line-height:1.8;
font-size:20px;
}

button{
padding:15px 35px;
font-size:18px;
border:none;
border-radius:50px;
background:white;
color:#ff4d6d;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:25px;
font-weight:bold;
transition:.3s;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
}

.gallery{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
gap:20px;
width:90%;
}

.gallery img{
width:100%;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}

#cake{
font-size:150px;
transition:1s;
}

.hidden{
display:none;
}

.fade{
animation:fade 1s;
}

@keyframes fade{
from{opacity:0;}
to{opacity:1;}
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<section>

<h1>🎂 Happy Birthday ❤️</h1>

<h2>My Love</h2>

<p>
I made something special just for you.
Today is all about celebrating the most beautiful person in my world.
</p>

<button onclick="next()">Start Surprise ❤️</button>

</section>

<section class="hidden">

<h2>💌 A Letter From My Heart</h2>

<p>

Happy Birthday ❤️

You deserve all the happiness this world can offer.

Thank you for being such an amazing person.

Your smile brightens every room.

Your kindness inspires everyone around you.

I hope every dream you make today becomes reality.

May this year bring endless happiness, success and beautiful memories.

</p>

<button onclick="next()">Continue 📸</button>

</section>

<section class="hidden">

<h2>Beautiful Memories ❤️</h2>

<div class="gallery">

<img src="photo1.jpg">
<img src="photo2.jpg">
<img src="photo3.jpg">
<img src="photo4.jpg">
<img src="photo5.jpg">
<img src="photo6.jpg">

</div>

<p>Every picture reminds me how wonderful you are.</p>

<button onclick="next()">Make A Wish ✨</button>

</section>

<section class="hidden">

<h2>✨ Close Your Eyes</h2>

<p>

Think about your biggest dream...

Now make your birthday wish.

</p>

<button onclick="wish()">🌟 Make My Wish</button>

</section>

<section class="hidden" id="candlePage">

<h2>🕯️ Blow Out The Candle</h2>

<div id="cake">🎂🕯️</div>

<button onclick="blow()">Blow Candle</button>

</section>

<section class="hidden" id="cakePage">

<h2>🍰 Time To Cut The Cake</h2>

<div id="cake2" style="font-size:150px;">🎂</div>

<button onclick="cutCake()">Cut Cake 🎉</button>

</section>

<section class="hidden">

<h1>🎉 Happy Birthday ❤️</h1>

<p>

I wish your smile never fades.

I wish every dream comes true.

I wish happiness always finds you.

Thank you for being such an incredible part of my life.

You deserve all the love, joy and success in the world.

May this birthday be as beautiful as your heart.

❤️

</p>

<h2>Forever Wishing You Happiness ❤️</h2>

</section>

<script>

let page=0;

const sections=document.querySelectorAll("section");

function next(){

sections[page].classList.add("hidden");

page++;

sections[page].classList.remove("hidden");

sections[page].classList.add("fade");

}

function wish(){

alert("✨ May all your birthday wishes come true ❤️");

next();

}

function blow(){

document.getElementById("cake").innerHTML="🎂";

alert("🎉 Candle Blown! Happy Birthday ❤️");

next();

}

function cutCake(){

document.getElementById("cake2").innerHTML="🍰";

alert("🎊 Cake Cut Successfully! ❤️");

next();

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
